sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant R as Redis (refresh tokens)
    participant S as API Service

    C->>A: POST /login
    A->>R: store refresh token (30d)
    A-->>C: access JWT (15 min) + refresh cookie
    C->>S: GET /orders + Bearer JWT
    S->>S: verify signature locally
    S-->>C: 200
    C->>A: POST /token/refresh
    A->>R: validate + rotate
    A-->>C: new access JWT
    Note over A,R: Compromise → revoke refresh token
